           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/rv790qz2532#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Ink; the three figure groups are plain, with the year written as 0 and 4. A signature follows which I cannot read; it seems to begin with a capital and then something like 'Sch'. 1904 sits just before the range given for the corpus, so the year may be worth a second reader."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
